message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "A303639 Counterexample Project"
authors:
  - family-names: "Jeong"
    given-names: "Sunsu"
date-released: 2026-08-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/DCLXAI/a303639-counterexample"
abstract: >
  A counterexample (n = 800,322,180) to a 2018 conjecture of Zhi-Wei Sun
  recorded in OEIS A303639, with machine-checkable certificates for all
  136 relevant pairs, an independent verifier, and an obstruction-structure
  analysis explaining why the counterexample occurs and is likely unique.
keywords:
  - number theory
  - OEIS
  - counterexample
  - computational mathematics
  - sum of two squares
